cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you utilize Saarthi or the NWIS framework in your academic research, policy analysis, or civic-tech evaluation, please cite it as below."
title: "NWIS: A Knowledge Graph-Based National Welfare Intelligence System for Citizen-Centric Governance and Policy Decision Support"
abstract: "Saarthi is an open-source civic-tech and welfare intelligence system designed to address statutory fragmentation and deep information asymmetry across Indian welfare programs. The architecture bridges citizen profiles, deterministic 3-valued Kleene logic Abstract Syntax Tree (AST) eligibility engines, status-aware document readiness verification, and administrative policy intelligence."
